                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Well, if it isn't my favorite partner-in-Shadow. I know. I should've reached out, but I've been busy chasing shadows... literally.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/VelmaVonVenkman_EMP_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340974,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC09_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "From what I heard, you've been chasing Shadows of your own. You've got quite the Grandfather Spider situation on your hands, don't you?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/VelmaVonVenkman_EMP_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340974,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC09_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You'll need to be prepared for whatever Spider throws at you next. You've met the Shadow Creatures before, even made pacts with them.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/VelmaVonVenkman_EMP_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340974,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC09_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But Spider is their creator, he will send legions of these things after you. So now, you need to know how to fight them.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/VelmaVonVenkman_EMP_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340974,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC09_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That's why I locked a Shadow Trickster away in this room. Let's see what you can do.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/VelmaVonVenkman_EMP_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340974,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC09_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You've got that smug, I-just-wiped-the-floor-with-a-Shadow-Trickster look, so I'm guessing your little jaunt was a success.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/VelmaVonVenkman_EMP_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340974,
